								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835560/extras/c094e0417fd5842ea79c40c28f8a873a.avif?t=1792162866" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835560/extras_big/c094e0417fd5842ea79c40c28f8a873a.webp?t=1792162866 width=1560 height=405 /></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Feed your passengers. Or they'll eat each other.</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Your passengers are hungry. Some are turning radioactive. The engine is burning, and the baby won't stop screaming. You're the crew. This is your problem.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835560/extras/8fde1d61ebc884097d8a4c3e495c58f4.avif?t=1792162866" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835560/extras_big/8fde1d61ebc884097d8a4c3e495c58f4.webp?t=1792162866 width=1560 height=416 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835560/extras/6a6469189edd25e59fb2be0ac853557c.poster.avif?t=1792162866" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835560/extras/6a6469189edd25e59fb2be0ac853557c.webm?t=1792162866" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835560/extras/6a6469189edd25e59fb2be0ac853557c.mp4?t=1792162866" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >One plane. Up to six idiots.</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Play solo or bring up to five friends to split the work. Serve food, cure radioactive passengers, climb onto the wing to repair engines, and patch holes before half the cabin gets sucked out.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835560/extras/359681134889439bbb56e6652a531988.avif?t=1792162866" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835560/extras_big/359681134889439bbb56e6652a531988.webp?t=1792162866 width=1560 height=447 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835560/extras/a7a134cfbbd9efe3fd1737c3ca924392.poster.avif?t=1792162866" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835560/extras/a7a134cfbbd9efe3fd1737c3ca924392.webm?t=1792162866" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835560/extras/a7a134cfbbd9efe3fd1737c3ca924392.mp4?t=1792162866" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Please don't eat the other passengers.</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Hungry chickens will eat each other. Radioactive ones can explode. Neither is great for business.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835560/extras/4ebcbedfc00c297cdb224e2bcef2b1dd.avif?t=1792162866" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835560/extras_big/4ebcbedfc00c297cdb224e2bcef2b1dd.webp?t=1792162866 width=1560 height=323 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835560/extras/c31aec99768713694c6a3f2364704669.poster.avif?t=1792162866" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835560/extras/c31aec99768713694c6a3f2364704669.webm?t=1792162866" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835560/extras/c31aec99768713694c6a3f2364704669.mp4?t=1792162866" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Choose your parenting style carefully.</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Try to calm the baby. If that fails, you can throw it off the plane. If you let it crawl away, it might reach the cockpit and start flying.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835560/extras/9a456d81a100cba28544ab0452db9fb8.avif?t=1792162866" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835560/extras_big/9a456d81a100cba28544ab0452db9fb8.webp?t=1792162866 width=1560 height=509 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835560/extras/7cbdf2117d9cfb983ad1c44b28acb739.poster.avif?t=1792162866" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835560/extras/7cbdf2117d9cfb983ad1c44b28acb739.webm?t=1792162866" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835560/extras/7cbdf2117d9cfb983ad1c44b28acb739.mp4?t=1792162866" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >If you can hear screaming, you still have passengers.</h2>						</div>
					</div>
				
				
				
